<article class="page">
  <h1 class="page__title">Newsletter</h1>

  <div class="page__body">
    <p>Occasional dispatches on data communication, information design, and whatever I'm reading or thinking about. No set cadence — I send when I have something worth saying.</p>

    <p>You can expect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>New posts from this site</li>
      <li>Links to work I find worth sharing</li>
      <li>The occasional longer thought that doesn't belong anywhere else</li>
    </ul>

    <p>No tracking pixels. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="newsletter-block newsletter-block--standalone">
    <form class="newsletter-form" action="/api/subscribe" method="post">
      <label for="email-newsletter">Email address</label>
      <div class="newsletter-form__row">
        <input
          type="email"
          id="email-newsletter"
          name="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          required
          class="newsletter-form__input"
          autocomplete="email"
        >
        <button type="submit" class="newsletter-form__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>

</article>
